### Test New Order Number Format
# This file tests the new order number format: SO-yymmdd<HCM><unique>

### 1. Create a new order to test the new order number format
POST https://localhost:7196/api/checkout/place-order
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "shippingAddressId": 1,
  "deliveryMethodId": 1,
  "paymentMethodId": 1,
  "comment": "Test order for new order number format"
}

### Expected Result:
# - Order number format should be: SO-yymmdd<HCM><unique>
# - Example: SO-241220HCM121534579912
# - Where:
#   - SO = Sales Order prefix
#   - 241220 = Date (24/12/20 for 2024-12-20)
#   - HCM = Ho Chi Minh branch code
#   - 121534579912 = Unique timestamp-based identifier

### 2. Get order details to verify the order number format
GET https://localhost:7196/api/orders/{{order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 3. List recent orders to see multiple order numbers
GET https://localhost:7196/api/orders?PageSize=5&SortBy=CreationTime&SortDirection=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
